svg.title:
\begin{aligned}
\frac{I(M^\star)}{\widehat L_{\mathrm{table}}(M^\star)}
&=
\sum_{C\in\mathcal C(M^\star)}
\underbrace{
\frac{T[|C|]}{\widehat L_{\mathrm{table}}(M^\star)}
}_{w_C}
\underbrace{
\frac{\sum_{i\in C}v_i}{T[|C|]}
}_{U(C)}\\
&=
\sum_{C\in\mathcal C(M^\star)}w_CU(C)
\le
\max_{C\in\mathcal C(M^\star)}U(C).
\end{aligned}
